#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:7
msgid "Ray Caster"
msgstr "射线投射器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:9
msgid "Ray patterns supported by the ray caster sensor"
msgstr "射线投射传感器支持的射线模式"

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:14
msgid ""
"A ray caster reports the first collision along each ray in a chosen pattern."
" Rays do not bounce or respond to materials and opacity. Quadruped tasks use"
" this sensor to measure terrain height around the robot."
msgstr "射线投射器报告所选模式中每条射线遇到的第一个碰撞点。射线不会反弹，也不受材质和不透明度影响。四足任务使用此传感器测量机器人周围的地形高度。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:18
msgid ""
"The ray-casting implementation depends on the physics backend. With PhysX "
"and OV PhysX, configured meshes are loaded into `Warp "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/warp/>`_ when the sensor initializes and must "
"remain static. With Newton, the sensor queries the live scene BVH and "
"therefore sees every collision shape in its environment, global terrain, and"
" dynamic bodies. Newton ignores "
":attr:`~sensors.RayCasterCfg.mesh_prim_paths`; use "
":class:`isaaclab_newton.sensors.NewtonRaycastSensorCfg` to make that "
"behavior explicit and to access Newton-specific options."
msgstr ""
"射线投射的实现取决于物理后端。在 PhysX 和 OV PhysX 上，配置的网格会在传感器初始化时加载到 `Warp "
"<https://nvidia.github.io/warp/>`_ ，且必须保持静止。在 Newton 上，传感器查询实时场景的 "
"BVH，因此能够感知所在环境中的所有碰撞形状、全局地形和动态刚体。Newton 会忽略 "
":attr:`~sensors.RayCasterCfg.mesh_prim_paths` ；可使用 "
":class:`isaaclab_newton.sensors.NewtonRaycastSensorCfg` 明确指定这一行为，并访问 Newton "
"特有的选项。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:27
msgid ""
"Choose a ray pattern and a parent frame. The frame and sensor offset set the"
" pose; the pattern sets the ray origins and directions. Built-in patterns "
"include lidar and grids."
msgstr "选择射线模式和父坐标系：坐标系及传感器偏移决定其位姿，模式决定射线起点和方向。内置模式包括激光雷达和网格。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:35
msgid ""
"Pattern angles use degrees. Enable debug visualization to inspect the "
"pattern, then disable it when measuring performance."
msgstr "模式中的角度采用度。可启用调试可视化检查模式，测量性能时再关闭。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:38
msgid "Lidar Pattern visualized"
msgstr "激光雷达模式可视化"

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:43
msgid "Read hit positions from ``data.ray_hits_w`` during simulation:"
msgstr "仿真期间，通过 ``data.ray_hits_w`` 读取命中位置："

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:81
msgid ""
"Hit positions have shape ``(N, B, 3)``, where ``N`` is the number of sensors"
" and ``B`` is the number of rays. Missed rays return ``inf``. The repeated "
"points in this example come from rays at the bottom pole of the "
"hemispherical lidar pattern: all 180 horizontal samples meet there."
msgstr ""
"命中位置的形状为 ``(N, B, 3)``，其中 ``N`` 是传感器数量，``B`` 是射线数量。未命中的射线返回 "
"``inf``。本例中的重复点来自半球激光雷达模式的底部极点，180 条水平方向的采样射线在那里重合。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/ray_caster.rst:86
msgid ""
"Try different patterns in the example below to inspect their hit positions."
msgstr "在下面的示例中尝试不同模式，查看各自的命中位置。"

